	name = "hull integrity report - final";
	default_raw_text = "Report forty-one. Aft hold plating is down to lace. No moisture, no oxygen, no cause. The corrosion moves inward from the Door, one plate a season, and it takes iron only - the wood it does not touch, like a reader skipping the words it already knows. Nobody reads these reports but the rust, and the rust files its own. This is my last one. Recommendation: let it finish.";
