/obj/item/paper{
	name = "the four-hundredth volume";
	default_raw_text = "Day one: the door did not open. Day two: the door did not open. I abridge. Year forty: the hinges have rusted, which is remarkable, because the door has no hinges. The rust is not decay. The rust is marginalia. The door has been answering me one flake at a time, and I have spent a lifetime learning to read it. Ask it nothing. Read everything.";
